105 dost\u0119pne w sprzeda\u017cy bezpo\u015brednio przed pokazem w kasie kina. Rezerwacji miejsc mo\u017cna dokonywa\u0107 przez profil <a href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/kinoport\/?locale=pl_PL\">KinoPortu na Facebooku<\/a> lub telefonicznie (tak\u017ce SMS) pod numerem <strong><a href=\"http:\/\/519 687 336\" data-wplink-url-error=\"true\">519 687 336<\/a>.<\/strong>\u00a0<\/p><p><strong>\u00a0<\/strong><\/p><h4 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"2kdqo\" data-start=\"50\" data-end=\"68\">Cennik bilet\u00f3w KinoPort GCSW<\/h4><div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\"><div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\"><table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"70\" data-end=\"224\"><thead data-start=\"70\" data-end=\"94\"><tr data-start=\"70\" data-end=\"94\"><th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"70\" data-end=\"86\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Rodzaj biletu<\/th><th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"86\" data-end=\"94\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Cena<\/th><\/tr><\/thead><tbody data-start=\"120\" data-end=\"224\"><tr data-start=\"120\" data-end=\"154\"><td data-start=\"120\" data-end=\"141\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"122\" data-end=\"140\">Bilet normalny<\/strong><\/td><td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"141\" data-end=\"154\"><strong data-start=\"143\" data-end=\"152\">15 z\u0142<\/strong><\/td><\/tr><tr data-start=\"155\" data-end=\"187\"><td data-start=\"155\" data-end=\"174\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"157\" data-end=\"173\">Bilet ulgowy<\/strong><\/td><td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"174\" data-end=\"187\"><strong data-start=\"176\" data-end=\"185\">12 z\u0142<\/strong><\/td><\/tr><tr data-start=\"188\" data-end=\"224\"><td data-start=\"188\" data-end=\"211\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"190\" data-end=\"210\">Bilet promocyjny<\/strong><\/td><td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"211\" data-end=\"224\"><strong data-start=\"213\" data-end=\"2